# CSharpier owns layout for everything it can format: C# and the XML around it,
# including the solution file.
#
# Verified rather than assumed: MSBuild property values survive reflowing intact
# (only leading indentation changes) and the build succeeds, and no XAML here
# carries significant inline text content, so reflowing attributes is safe.

# Build output. CSharpier skips obj/ and bin/ by default, but generated sources
# under them are the compiler's to format, not ours.
**/obj/
**/bin/
artifacts/
node_modules/
